      \field{abstract}{SiOx films were deposited by reactive rf magnetron sputtering using a sintered SiO target. The composition of the deposited SiOx films was controlled from 0{$\cdot$}98 to 1{$\cdot$}74 by changing oxygen flow ratio at deposition. Refractive indexes of the resultant SiOx films were 1{$\cdot$}85 to 1{$\cdot$}50 at a wavelength of 0{$\cdot$}633 nm, and the dielectric constant of those were 5{$\cdot$}34 to 3{$\cdot$}52 at 100 kHz, with varying the x in SiOx film from 0{$\cdot$}98 to 1{$\cdot$}74.}
